[35mREADME.md[m[36m:[m[32m147[m[36m:[mⓘ All collaboration tools in [1;31mDocuWrite Pro[m are built using **PeerJS** and **WebRTC**, which allow real-time communication directly between users’ devices. This means that your files, edits, and messages never pass through [1;31mDocuWrite Pro[m’s servers, ensuring full privacy and security. By using this peer-to-peer approach, [1;31mDocuWrite Pro[m keeps your data safe while still enabling features like live collaboration, file sharing, and team editing.  
