[35marchive/Submit_a_Template.scd[m[36m:[m[32m61[m[36m:[m    "<h1><span style=\"font-family: Black Ops One;\">SUBMIT&nbsp; A&nbsp; TEMPLATE</span></h1><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Have you made a document template that others could use, customize, or learn from? Share it with the community and help make [1;31mDocuWrite Pro[m’s template library better for everyone.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Revalia;\"><b>How do I prepare the document?</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><ol><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Create an amazing document!</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Name the document whatever you want! This will be your </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">template title</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Redact all personal information, using placeholders (as </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">[example]</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">) is highly recommended.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">If you are using locally imported fonts, try finding that font on </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Google Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">. If found, use that font instead, load it through the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Online Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> section in the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> menu.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Set the editor to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Editing</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> mode and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">zoom</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">100%</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Make sure there are no misspelled words. Use the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Spell Check</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Grammar Check</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">&nbsp;feature from </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Assistive Writing</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Make sure no offensive words or phrases are in the document, you may use the built-in </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Avoid Offensive Content</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> feature within </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Assistive Writing.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Before exporting disable any </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Assistive Writing</span><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">&nbsp;feature and enabled </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Add-on.</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Click the </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Export</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> button, then click </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Export Options</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">. Afterward, select </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">SCD</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">. Make sure that </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Lock All Images</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Global Fonts</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> toggles are turned on, and </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Image Quality</span><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\"> is set to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">100%</span></li><li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Click </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Export SCD.</span></li></ol><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Revalia;\"><b>How do I submit?</b></span></div><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">Send an email to </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 224, 224); font-family: Stardos Stencil;\">mohtadiazadmahi902@gmail.com</span><span style=\"font-family